3. **Fan-Work & Copyright Disclaimer**:
   - This mod is an unofficial, non-commercial fan-made derivative work inspired by *The Eminence in Shadow* (*Kage no Jitsuryokusha ni Naritakute!*), written by Daisuke Aizawa and illustrated by Touzai (published by KADOKAWA).
